    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's company context, our company's have experience with public procurement in various EU jurisdictions, including Italy, France, Germany, Belgium, and EU institutions. our company's standard contractual clauses include a data protection agreement template (DPA) version 3.2, which is based on Article 6(1)(e) of GDPR for the performance of tasks in the public interest. our company's also have a no-copyleft GPL contamination policy and ensure that all client data remains the sole property of the contracting authority." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding intellectual property, our company's default model is work-for-hire, with all deliverables transferred to the client upon final payment. our company's have source code escrow capability through Logitas (France) and use standard licenses such as Apache 2.0, MIT, and LGPL v2.1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of liability and insurance, our company's have a limitation of liability of 3 million euros, professional indemnity insurance of 5 million euros, cyber liability insurance of 2 million euros, and performance bond capacity of 1.5 million euros through AXA XL, with policies valid until December 31, 2025." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's requirements for compliance with GDPR and no automated decisions without explicit validation of an agent, potential legal risks associated with this project include non-compliance with GDPR regulations, particularly regarding data protection and privacy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate potential legal risks associated with this project, our company's can ensure that our company's solution is designed as a tool of assistance, with no automated decision-making capabilities without explicit validation by an agent. our company's should also conduct regular audits to ensure compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR and EU AI Act. our company's standard contractual clauses already include provisions for data return on termination, data destruction certificates, and price revision mechanisms." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our company's must carefully review and negotiate the contract to ensure that the contract meets all the client's requirements and constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's ai_regulatory_knowledge includes expertise in EU AI Act, awareness of prohibited AI practices, and transparency obligations for limited-risk AI solutions. our company's also have human oversight contractual enforcement and a no-automated-decision-without-human-validation policy, which aligns with the client's expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To further ensure compliance, our company's should conduct thorough risk assessments, provide regular training to our company's personnel on GDPR and AI regulatory requirements, and maintain open communication with the client to address any concerns or issues that may arise during the project." ;
