    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an artificial intelligence solution that provides assistance with information access, improves quality of answers, reduces processing times, and integrates with existing systems of information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's LLM stack, RAG capabilities, fine-tuning methods, explainability tools, performance benchmarks, past AI use cases, and known trade-offs as of 2024, what are the potential innovation opportunities associated with this project, and how can our company's leverage our company's AI expertise to deliver a cutting-edge solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company's context, our company's have several capabilities that align with The client requirements. our company's LLM stack includes models like Mistral 7B, LLaMA 3 8B, and CamemBERT, which can be fine-tuned using methods like LoRA, QLoRA, or full fine-tuning on a domain corpus to improve performance. our company's also have experience with RAG capabilities, including retrieval strategies like dense vector semantic search and BM25 sparse search, as well as chunking strategies like recursive text splitter and semantic chunking." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the client's need for assistance with information access, our company's can leverage our company's RAG capabilities to provide a robust question-answering system. our company's typical retrieval precision at 5 is 0.87, and our company's typical answer relevance score is 0.84, which indicates that our company's RAG system can effectively retrieve relevant information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To improve the quality of answers, our company's can fine-tune our company's LLMs on the client's specific domain corpus, which has been shown to result in an average accuracy gain of 12%. our company's also have experience with explainability tools like source citation, chain-of-thought display, SHAP for classification models, and LIME, which can provide transparency into the decision-making process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of reducing processing times, our company's quantisation methods like INT8, INT4 (GPTQ), and GGUF can help optimize the performance of our company's LLMs. our company's have also demonstrated that our company's sovereign open-weight model, Mistral 7B, can achieve strong performance while minimizing energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To integrate with existing systems of information, our company's can leverage our company's experience with vector stores like Qdrant, Weaviate, pgvector, and FAISS to develop a seamless integration with the client's existing infrastructure. our company's past AI use cases in public administration, legal sector, healthcare, and smart city domains demonstrate our company's ability to deliver effective AI solutions that meet the needs of various industries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Potential innovation opportunities for this project include: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Developing a customized RAG system that leverages our company's LLMs and fine-tuning methods to provide accurate and relevant answers to the client's specific questions. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Implementing explainability tools to provide transparency into the decision-making process, which can help build trust with the client and end-users. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

