        ex:hasText "Optimizing the performance of our LLMs using quantisation methods to reduce processing times and minimize energy consumption. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integrating our company's AI solution with the client's existing systems of information to provide a seamless user experience." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's AI expertise and capabilities, our company's can deliver a cutting-edge solution that meets the client's requirements and provides a competitive advantage in the market." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects the solution to contribute to the reduction of the energetic consumption and rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what are the potential CSR and sustainability implications associated with this project, and how can our company's ensure that our company's solution aligns with The client environmental goals?" ;
