    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability Officer at our company's, I recognize the importance of addressing The client expectations regarding reducing energetic consumption and relying on low-carbon infrastructures. our company's has a Silver EcoVadis rating with a score of 62, indicating a good level of commitment to sustainability. our company's have already taken steps to reduce our company's environmental impact through our company's green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy." ;
