    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's AI ethics principles emphasize transparency, explainability, and human oversight, which can help ensure that our solution is designed with sustainability in mind. our company's can provide explicit information about the environmental impact of our solution and work with the client to identify areas for improvement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure that our solution meets The client expectations, our company's will conduct a thorough analysis of our company's carbon footprint and identify opportunities for reduction. our company's carbon reporting capability, based on GRI Standards (partial), will enable our company's to track and disclose our company's greenhouse gas emissions. our company's aim to reduce our company's total Scope 1 and 2 tCO2e emissions, currently at 148, and strive towards our company's net-zero target year of 2040." ;
